/arc-plc/nevada/douglas-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids shows September to October under 90% of normal in 44 of 75 years. On the middle of the grids, May to June came in at 44% of normal in 2025, and July to August came in at 165% in 2025. Every grid had its driest year in 2013, and grid 22840 got 33% of normal in 2013.</p>"}
